<title>USA: Innovo Group buys back 1.2 mln warrants.</title>
<headline>Innovo Group buys back 1.2 mln warrants.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Tenn. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovo Group Inc said Tuesday it had bought back 1.2 million stock purchase warrants for $150,000.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of back packs, duffel bags and other bags issued the warrants, which have an exercise price of $0.17, last year.</p>
<p>&quot;By retiring these options, the company has eliminated a 1.2 million share overhang in the market,&quot; said Chief Executive L.E. Smith in a statement.</p>
<p>The company's stock traded at 11/16 Tuesday morning, down 3/32.</p>
